description: Require all commit messages in English
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commit Language Rule

- All commit messages in this project must be written in English.
- Use concise prefixes when appropriate: `feat:`, `fix:`, `refactor:`, `chore:`, `docs:`.
- Do not mix Portuguese and English in the same commit title or body.
- This rule applies to all future commits in this repository.
